+	<!-- advc.912d -->
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>TXT_KEY_BUILDING_GRANARY_STRATEGY</Tag>
+		<English>[COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Granaries[COLOR_REVERT] store food to help increase a city's growth rate. They add additional health if your civ has access to [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Corn[COLOR_REVERT], [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Wheat[COLOR_REVERT], and [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Rice[COLOR_REVERT]. [BOLD]AdvCiv[\BOLD] slightly reduces the amount of [ICON_FOOD] stored - except when playing with the [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]No Slavery[COLOR_REVERT] option. ([LINK=CIVIC_SLAVERY]Slavery[\LINK] has a powerful synergy with [ICON_FOOD] being stored after growth.)</English>
+		<French>Les [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]greniers[COLOR_REVERT] stockent de la nourriture pour favoriser la croissance de la ville. Ils am&#233;liorent la sant&#233; des citoyens si votre civilisation dispose de [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]ma&#239;s[COLOR_REVERT], de [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]bl&#233;[COLOR_REVERT] et de [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]riz[COLOR_REVERT].</French>
+		<German>[COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Kornspeicher[COLOR_REVERT] beschleunigen das Bev&#246;lkerungswachstum und verbessern die Gesundheit Ihrer Zivilisation, wenn Sie &#252;ber [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Mais[COLOR_REVERT], [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Weizen[COLOR_REVERT] und [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Reis[COLOR_REVERT] verf&#252;gen. [BOLD]AdvCiv[\BOLD] verringert den Wachstumseffekt ein wenig - au�er wenn die Option [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Keine Sklaverei[COLOR_REVERT] aktiviert ist. (Die Staatsform [LINK=CIVIC_SLAVERY]Sklaverei[\LINK] profitiert besonders von beschleunigtem Bev�lkerungswachstum.)</German>
+		<Italian>I [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]granai[COLOR_REVERT] conservano il cibo per favorire la crescita della citt&#224;. Se la tua civilt&#224; ha accesso a [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Granoturco[COLOR_REVERT], [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Frumento[COLOR_REVERT] e [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Riso[COLOR_REVERT], genereranno salute extra.</Italian>
+		<Spanish>Los [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Graneros[COLOR_REVERT] almacenan alimentos, lo que ayuda a aumentar el ritmo de crecimiento de la ciudad. Suman m&#225;s salud si la civilizaci&#243;n tiene acceso al [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Ma&#237;z[COLOR_REVERT], el [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Trigo[COLOR_REVERT] y el [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Arroz[COLOR_REVERT].</Spanish>
